			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4468522">
									

<p>This is pretty good (I really liked the generically named products, and 685 December), but ultimately felt a little too explicit/explain-y for my liking. We learn pretty early on that this is Joe's inability deal with grief, and the story doesn't really escalate much from there. The interpretive dreaming record seemed a big leap from a believability perspective, especially when most of that information was covered elsewhere - it might have been better to put all this into another video log, to make it shown not told.</p>
<p>Some spelling notes: I think &quot;sheering&quot; should be &quot;shearing&quot;, and there's an &quot;Anway&quot; in the final log that should be &quot;Anyway&quot;, as well as a &quot;he had no dwelt&quot; which should be &quot;not dwelt&quot;, unless Dureau is Scottish ;)</p>

							</div>

								
					
